BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:heraklion-agios-thomas-panigiri-of-panagia-karkadiotissa-agios-thomas-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270907
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270909
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Karkadiotissa\, Agios Thomas
LOCATION:Agios Thomas\, Crete (Heraklion)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:For the Nativity of the Virgin the Messara village of Agios Thomas walks out to the 14th-century chapel of Panagia Karkadiotissa by the river for vespers on the evening of 7 September\, followed by a glenti\; it is the last big panigiri of the Heraklion season. The chapel is a short walk from the village\; bring a torch for the way back.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/heraklion/#agios-thomas-panigiri-of-panagia-karkadiotissa-agios-thomas
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/heraklion/#agios-thomas-panigiri-of-panagia-karkadiotissa-agios-thomas
END:VEVENT
